  "details": "If the day is 2790, it shows \"Day 2790\" (1st image). \n\nIf you choose Japanese as the Preferred Language, it shows \"日 2790\" (2nd image). This is very weird in the Japanese language; it must be \"2790 日\"\n\nThe \"Unit + Number\" format is a part of English grammar. Please format it as a string for the localization.",
